      {
        "text": "The Brushfire platform's video content streaming application (https://online.brushfire.com) exposes database path in requests to users, allowing a remote, unauthenticated attacker to read information about other users. ",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed February 2026.",
